// P3G.1 (external-references.md ER2.2, ER3.1, ER3.2, ER3.5, ER6.2; derived-and-linking.md DV1.1,
// DV1.8; lesson-referencing-versions-within-a-document.png, ex1-step2.png): one document,
// "Block versions" (`cadrs_core::samples::linked_block`: the Part Studio "Block", 50 × 30 × 25,
// and an empty "Assembly 1"), referencing its own studio at a version and at the workspace.
// 01 the Block studio (25 high).
// 02 (ER2.2) the top bar's Create version button, its tooltip.
// 03 (ER6.2, ex1-step2) "Create version from Main": Name V1, a description typed, Create, Create
//    version and edit properties, Cancel.
// 04 "Create version and edit properties": the version made, the History panel opened on V1
//    (its name, who, when and the description); the top bar's versions counter reads 1.
// 05 Assembly 1 → Insert: Current document, "Block versions" and its branch "Main", with the
//    insert rigid, Create version and Version graph buttons.
// 06 (ER3.2) the Version graph: the Workspace / Version legend, Main (the workspace, selected),
//    V1, Start.
// 07 V1 picked: "Block versions ↳ V1" and the studio as it was at V1.
// 08 its part placed; then the graph → Main and the workspace part placed beside it
//    ("Inserted: 2").
// 09 accepted: "Part 1 <1>" (V1) and "Part 1 <2>" (workspace: one sequence per part, as
//    Onshape numbers them); <1> shows the version icon at the right of its row, its tooltip "References Block versions ›
//    Block (V1) of this document…"; the workspace instance has none.
// 10 (ER3.1, DV1.1) the Block studio's Extrude 1 set to 40 in the workspace
//    (`linked-block height 40`): in Assembly 1 the workspace instance follows (40 high), the V1
//    instance doesn't (25).
// 11 mass properties of the V1 instance: 37 500 mm³ (50 · 30 · 25).
// 12 of the workspace instance: 60 000 mm³ (50 · 30 · 40).
// 13 (DV1.8, ER X3) Insert → Create version beside the graph: V2 made on the fly and selected
//    ("↳ V2", the studio 40 high in the thumbnails).
// 14 the graph now: Main, V2 (selected), V1, Start. Cancelled. (P3G.2: <1> at V1 now shows the
//    blue update badge, V2 being newer.)
// 15 (ER6.6, DV2.3) the V1 instance Fastened onto the fixed workspace instance
//    (`linked-block mate`: its bottom-face centre on the other's top-face centre, as the unit test
//    `linked_instances_mate_and_keep_their_properties_in_the_bom`): 25 high on 40.
// 16 (DV2.3) the workspace part numbered BLK-002 (`linked-block part-number BLK-002`), the BOM
//    open: the workspace Part 1 has BLK-002, the V1 Part 1 keeps V1's properties (no part number).
Scenario(
    start: Some("document"),
    steps: [
        WaitFor("document-shell"),
        Custom("linked-block versions"),
        Key("F"),
        MoveTo(1420, 780),
        Wait(3),
        Screenshot("01-block-studio"),
        Hover(ui("document-create-version")),
        Wait(40),
        Screenshot("02-create-version-button"),
        Click(ui("document-create-version")),
        WaitFor("create-version-dialog"),
        Click(ui("create-version-description-field")),
        Type("The block, 25 high"),
        Screenshot("03-create-version-dialog"),
        Click(ui("create-version-edit-properties")),
        MoveTo(1420, 780),
        Wait(3),
        Screenshot("04-version-made-history-open"),
        Click(ui("history-close")),
        Click(ui("tab-assembly-1")),
        Click(ui("insert")),
        WaitFor("insert-dialog"),
        Hover(ui("insert-version")),
        Wait(40),
        Screenshot("05-insert-current-document"),
        Click(ui("insert-version")),
        WaitFor("insert-graph"),
        MoveTo(1420, 780),
        Wait(3),
        Screenshot("06-version-graph"),
        Click(ui("insert-graph-node-1")),
        MoveTo(1420, 780),
        Wait(3),
        Screenshot("07-at-v1"),
        Click(ui("insert-part-part-1")),
        Hover(world(80, 40)),
        Wait(3),
        Click(world(80, 40)),
        Click(ui("insert-version")),
        WaitFor("insert-graph"),
        Click(ui("insert-graph-node-0")),
        Click(ui("insert-part-part-1")),
        Hover(world(80, -60)),
        Wait(3),
        Click(world(80, -60)),
        Hover(ui("insert-count")),
        Wait(3),
        Screenshot("08-inserted-2"),
        Click(ui("insert-dialog-accept")),
        Key("F"),
        Hover(ui("instance-row-1-linked")),
        Wait(40),
        Screenshot("09-version-instance-icon"),
        Custom("linked-block height 40"),
        Key("F"),
        MoveTo(1420, 780),
        Wait(3),
        Screenshot("10-workspace-follows-version-frozen"),
        Click(ui("instance-row-1")),
        Click(ui("view-mass")),
        WaitFor("mass-dialog"),
        MoveTo(1420, 780),
        Wait(3),
        Screenshot("11-version-instance-37500"),
        Click(ui("mass-dialog-cancel")),
        // A row click toggles it: <1> off, <2> on.
        Click(ui("instance-row-1")),
        Click(ui("instance-row-2")),
        Click(ui("view-mass")),
        WaitFor("mass-dialog"),
        MoveTo(1420, 780),
        Wait(3),
        Screenshot("12-workspace-instance-60000"),
        Click(ui("mass-dialog-cancel")),
        Click(ui("insert")),
        WaitFor("insert-dialog"),
        Click(ui("insert-version")),
        WaitFor("insert-graph"),
        Click(ui("insert-graph-node-1")),
        Click(ui("insert-create-version")),
        WaitFor("create-version-dialog"),
        Click(ui("create-version-create")),
        MoveTo(1420, 780),
        Wait(3),
        Screenshot("13-v2-made-on-the-fly"),
        Click(ui("insert-version")),
        WaitFor("insert-graph"),
        MoveTo(1420, 780),
        Wait(3),
        Screenshot("14-graph-with-v2"),
        Click(ui("insert-dialog-cancel")),
        Custom("linked-block mate"),
        Key("F"),
        MoveTo(1420, 780),
        Wait(3),
        Screenshot("15-v1-instance-fastened"),
        Custom("linked-block part-number BLK-002"),
        Click(ui("panel-bom")),
        MoveTo(1420, 780),
        Wait(3),
        Screenshot("16-bom-at-a-version"),
    ],
)
